medial margin  is an unoriented portion of fibroadipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  inked and sectioned to reveal unremarkable fibroadipose tissue with focal fibrocystic changes  submitted entirely in cassettes E through J  Labeled as  left breast  final shaved margins  are three fragments of fibroadipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm in aggregate  They are inked and sectioned to reveal fibroadipose tissue with focal cystic changes  Representative sections are submitted in cassettes K  L and M  Labeled as  left axillary contents  is an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm portion of adipose tissue from which multiple lymph nodes are extracted  ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE to 1 7cm in greatest dimension  submitted in N through S  Labeled as  reexcision  right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm portion of fibroadipose tissue with a REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm skin ellipse containing a 4 8cm well healed  linear scar  There is a long stitch designating the lateral aspect  and a short stitch designating the superior aspect which is inked in blue  while the inferior aspect is inked in black  The specimen is sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm biopsy cavity with an associated area of stellate fibrosis measuring REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm and extending to the superior and inferior margins  Posterior to the biopsy cavity is a rubbery  tan white  nodular mass measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm and present at superior  inferior and posterior margins  The biopsy cavity itself is 0 2cm from the nearest  inferior  margin  Section code  T W  Biopsy cavity  nearest margin in W  lateral to medial X Y  Adjacent fibrous areas Z  Uninvolved parenchyma Designated right axillary contents is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm portion of adipose tissue from which several node like structures have been extracted ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE to 1 5cm in greatest dimension and submitted in cassettes AA through DD  Labeled as  additional axillary tissue  right  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm portion of adipose tissue from which several node like structures have been extracted ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE to 1 0cm in greatest dimension submitted entirely in cassette EE  Resident  DANIELLE ELLIOTT  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION PART C  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA   EXCISION PART D  LYMPH NODES   ADDITIONAL RIGHT AXILLA    EXCISION PART E  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLA   EXCISION PART F  BREAST  LEFT  ADDITIONAL ANTERIOR MARGIN    EZXCIS PART G  BREAST  LEFT  FINAL SHAVED MARGINS    EXCISION   report_end  , Positive.
