sis  which is previously dyed blue  Inferior to the biopsy cavity is a second area of tan white fibrosis measuring REMOVED_DATE x 4cm  No other masses or nodules are identified in the remaining breast parenchyma  which is focally fibrotic  The area corresponding to the axillary region is examined for lymph nodes  none are identified  Representative sections of the specimen are submitted as follows  C E  Biopsy cavity  F H  Representative sections from area previously dyed blue  I J  Representative sections from fibrotic area inferior to biopsy cavity  K L  Representative sections of fibrosis away from biopsy cavity  M N  Representative sections of posterior margin closest to biopsy cavity  radially submitted   Resident  ALIYAH RAHEMTULLAH  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1 2  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLARY  SENTINEL   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  O R  Resident  RANIA M  SELIEM  MD O R  Diagnosis by  CHIN LEE WU  MD  PhD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTPATIENT  OFF P CLINIC  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLARY SENTINEL   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Unknown.
